# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# /api/* requests are proxied to the Cloudflare Worker
/api/* https://csa-api.rashidjumachepkwony.workers.dev/api/:splat 200

# NOTE: no SPA fallback — this is a multi-page static site and every internal
# link uses explicit .html paths. A `/* /index.html 200` catch-all masked 404
# errors, so it was removed. Unmatched paths are served by 404.html
# (Netlify serves it automatically; Cloudflare Pages uses it as the not-found page).
